pageType: final
background:
  type: gradient
  gradientType: radial
  stops:
    - {position: 0, color: "#1a2a38"}
    - {position: 1, color: "#0f1a22"}
elements:
  - elementId: final-accent-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [540, 200, 200, 4]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: final-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [140, 230, 1000, 70]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      fontSize: 48
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>SIMA</p>
  - elementId: final-subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [240, 320, 800, 40]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 22
      color: "$lightText"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>De la clase a la dominación, paso a paso</p>
  - elementId: final-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [240, 380, 800, 120]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$secondary"
      align: [center, middle]
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        <p>Convierte tus grabaciones y apuntes en material de estudio inteligente.</p>
        <p>Evaluaciones adaptativas que entienden tu nivel.</p>
        <p>Microaprendizaje que se siente como un juego.</p>
  - elementId: final-badge-green
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [380, 530, 160, 40]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [100000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: final-badge-green-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [380, 530, 160, 40]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$lightText"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>Hecho en Perú</p>
  - elementId: final-badge-blue
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [560, 530, 160, 40]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [100000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$info"
  - elementId: final-badge-blue-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [560, 530, 160, 40]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$lightText"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>Para universitarios</p>
  - elementId: final-badge-yellow
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [740, 530, 160, 40]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [100000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$warning"
  - elementId: final-badge-yellow-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [740, 530, 160, 40]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$primary"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>En desarrollo activo</p>
  - elementId: final-footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [340, 600, 600, 30]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$secondary"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>Sistema Inteligente de Microaprendizaje Adaptativo</p>
